Cell["\<\
[3] the layered field: plane force at zSrc above a layer [0, D], exact.\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"54aa9871-0f36-4a6b-85a6-d5c727e4f96a"],

Cell["\<\
Regions: 1 z < 0 (background, source), 2 0 < z < D (layer), 3 z > D \
(background). u1 = g(z - zs) + R Exp[-i k0 z];  u2 = B Exp[i k1 z] + C Exp[-i \
k1 z]; u3 = T Exp[i k0 (z - D)].  Continuity of u and M u' at z = 0 and z = D.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4ffe3818-eb20-451b-a208-2184d7148569"],

Cell["\<\
ztop: None for an outgoing condition above (P: the matched fluid layer 0 is \
transparent), or the depth of a TRACTION-FREE boundary (S: the layered \
solver's layer 0 is a fluid, which carries no shear -- \
Mathematica/OceanBoundary.wl), where u' = 0 and region 1 gains a downgoing \
wave\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"44b80ab0-e05d-4d24-8c37-36d71c3bfd3f"],

